{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-lod","title":"性能优化与动画 LOD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/advanced-runtime/performance-lod","wordCount":1314,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能优化与动画-lod\">性能优化与动画 LOD</h1><p>前面所有章节描述的算法——采样、蒙皮、混合树、状态机、IK、布偶、动作匹配、面部——在一个角色身上单独看都不贵，但把它们叠在一起、再乘以一个挤满几百上千个角色的战场，一帧十几毫秒的预算瞬间见底。性能优化与动画 LOD 回答贯穿全 hub 的那个朴素问题：这一切凭什么都跑得完。它是把前面的&quot;能做&quot;变成出货游戏&quot;做得起&quot;的工程地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动画的每帧开销分布在几个阶段，优化就是逐阶段砍掉用户看不见的成本。核心思想是 <strong>LOD（Level of Detail）</strong>：离镜头越远、越不重要的角色，动画算得越粗——更少的骨骼、更低的更新频率、更简单的算法，因为玩家根本分辨不出差别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[更新调度&lt;br/&gt;谁本帧需要算] --&gt; B[姿态求值&lt;br/&gt;采样+混合+状态机]&#10;  B --&gt; C[程序化阶段&lt;br/&gt;IK/物理 可按 LOD 跳过]&#10;  C --&gt; D[骨骼层级累乘&lt;br/&gt;local 到 model]&#10;  D --&gt; E[蒙皮&lt;br/&gt;多在 GPU]&#10;  E --&gt; F[上屏]&#10;  G[距离/可见性/重要度] --&gt;|决定每阶段精度| A&#10;  G -.-&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[更新调度&lt;br/&gt;谁本帧需要算] --&gt; B[姿态求值&lt;br/&gt;采样+混合+状态机]\n  B --&gt; C[程序化阶段&lt;br/&gt;IK/物理 可按 LOD 跳过]\n  C --&gt; D[骨骼层级累乘&lt;br/&gt;local 到 model]\n  D --&gt; E[蒙皮&lt;br/&gt;多在 GPU]\n  E --&gt; F[上屏]\n  G[距离/可见性/重要度] --&gt;|决定每阶段精度| A\n  G -.-&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主要成本</th>\n<th>主要优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>更新调度</td>\n<td>全量每帧更新</td>\n<td>按距离降频、视锥剔除、跳帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>姿态求值</td>\n<td>大量片段采样混合</td>\n<td>骨骼 LOD、降低动作匹配查询频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>程序化</td>\n<td>IK 迭代、物理仿真</td>\n<td>远处直接跳过 IK 与布偶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级累乘</td>\n<td>全骨遍历</td>\n<td>骨骼 LOD 减少骨数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙皮</td>\n<td>海量顶点</td>\n<td>GPU 蒙皮、网格 LOD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"更新预算与调度\">更新预算与调度</h2><p>最大的浪费是&quot;给玩家根本看不见的角色每帧算满&quot;。优化第一刀砍在调度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可见性剔除</strong>：视锥外、被遮挡的角色不更新动画（但要小心声音/逻辑仍需推进时间）。</li>\n<li><strong>按距离降频</strong>：近处角色每帧更新，中距离每 2 帧，远处每 4~8 帧，帧间靠插值或直接定格。设角色距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，更新间隔可按区间阶梯映射。</li>\n<li><strong>更新预算上限</strong>：给整个动画系统设每帧的角色更新数上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，超出的按重要度排序轮流更新（time-slicing），保证帧率稳定而非随人数线性恶化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常用的重要度评分把距离、屏幕占比、是否玩家关注综合成单一优先级，调度器据此分配本帧的算力——这把&quot;哪些角色配享受动作匹配（<a href=\"motion-matching\">动作匹配与运动场</a>）、哪些只配简单混合&quot;也一并决定了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"骨骼-lod-与算法降级\">骨骼 LOD 与算法降级</h2><p>第二刀砍在每个角色内部的精度。<strong>骨骼 LOD</strong>：主角近景用完整 200+ 骨（含手指、面部），拉远后丢掉手指骨、再远丢掉面部骨、最远只留躯干十几根骨。骨数直接决定 <a href=\"../foundations/skeletal-skinning\">骨骼与蒙皮</a> 里层级累乘与蒙皮矩阵上传的开销，砍骨是线性收益。</p>\n<p><strong>算法降级</strong>沿距离梯次关闭昂贵特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>距离档</th>\n<th>骨骼</th>\n<th>IK</th>\n<th>物理布偶</th>\n<th>面部</th>\n<th>移动动画</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>近</td>\n<td>全骨</td>\n<td>全开</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>blendshape 全开</td>\n<td>动作匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>去手指</td>\n<td>仅足部</td>\n<td>简化</td>\n<td>仅口型</td>\n<td>混合空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远</td>\n<td>躯干骨</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>冻结</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>单循环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极远</td>\n<td>公告板/不更新</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>定格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>远处关掉 IK（<a href=\"../procedural-ik/inverse-kinematics\">反向动力学 IK</a>）和布偶（<a href=\"../procedural-ik/physics-ragdoll\">物理与布偶</a>）尤其划算——它们最贵又最看不出来。注意降级切换要有滞回（hysteresis）阈值，否则角色在档位边界反复横跳会&quot;闪烁&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多线程与数据布局\">多线程与数据布局</h2><p>姿态求值天然可并行：每个角色的采样—混合—累乘相互独立，是典型的数据并行任务，现代引擎都把它派进作业系统（job system）在多核上铺开。要让多线程真正快，数据布局要对缓存友好——把骨骼变换、关键帧紧凑连续地存放（结构数组转数组结构，SoA），让 SIMD 一次处理多骨。UE 的动画求值与 Unity 的 DOTS/Burst 编译路线都建立在这套&quot;数据导向 + 多线程&quot;之上。蒙皮则几乎全在 GPU 顶点着色器并行完成，CPU 只负责算出并上传蒙皮矩阵数组（见 <a href=\"../foundations/skeletal-skinning\">骨骼与蒙皮</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-预算与取舍哲学\">度量、预算与取舍哲学</h2><p>优化的前提是度量：用引擎自带的分析器（profiler）把动画耗时拆到上述每个阶段，找出真正的瓶颈再动手，而非凭直觉。一个朴素的总预算约束是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{N} c_i \\le T_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个角色本帧的动画成本、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是分配给动画系统的每帧毫秒数。LOD 与调度的全部工作，就是在保证视觉质量的前提下让左边不超过右边。这条不等式背后是贯穿全 hub 的统一事实：所有动画技术最终都在争抢同一份每帧预算——这正是把它们放进一个 hub 通盘理解、而非各自孤立学习的根本理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>动画每帧成本分调度、求值、程序化、累乘、蒙皮五阶段，逐阶段按 LOD 砍。</li>\n<li>调度先剔不可见、按距离降频、设更新预算上限做 time-slicing。</li>\n<li>骨骼 LOD 按距离减骨；IK 与布偶在远处直接关闭，切换要带滞回防闪烁。</li>\n<li>姿态求值多线程 + 缓存友好布局（SoA/SIMD），蒙皮交 GPU。</li>\n<li>一切归结为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>budget</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum c_i \\le T_{\\text{budget}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">budget</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：所有动画技术争抢同一份每帧预算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能优化与动画 LOD","id":"性能优化与动画-lod"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"更新预算与调度","id":"更新预算与调度"},{"level":2,"text":"骨骼 LOD 与算法降级","id":"骨骼-lod-与算法降级"},{"level":2,"text":"多线程与数据布局","id":"多线程与数据布局"},{"level":2,"text":"度量、预算与取舍哲学","id":"度量-预算与取舍哲学"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"面部动画与口型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/advanced-runtime/facial-lipsync"},"next":null}